problem: given a tuple (g, A =

ga, B = gb, C = gc, T), the problem is to decide whether T = ˆe(g,
g)abcor whether it is a random

element of GT. More formally, we define the following game between an
adversary A and a challenger.

The challenger first chooses a random generator g←G∗, random integers a,
b, c←Zp, a random

